(6404472, 949491, 129267, '<td valign="top">cute idea. some of the details make this shot a little less powerful - dusty glasses, skewed rotations of the glasses (in the 3 stack, not the shredder).<br/> <br/>I like the green light reference, but also think this could have done well with a really urban texture/ brick/concrete.</td>', 'cute idea. some of the details make this shot a little less powerful - dusty glasses, skewed rotations of the glasses (in the 3 stack, not the shredder). I like the green light reference, but also think this could have done well with a really urban texture/ brick/concrete.', '2011-05-04 20:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404473, 949665, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting visual, i think I would have liked it to be cropped just a hair tighter, to emphasize the busyness even more. <br/> <br/>lighting is appropriate, and the black reflections hold good contrast. lot''s of fun interesting details.</td>', 'interesting visual, i think I would have liked it to be cropped just a hair tighter, to emphasize the busyness even more.  lighting is appropriate, and the black reflections hold good contrast. lot''s of fun interesting details.', '2011-05-04 20:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404477, 948526, 129267, '<td valign="top">this shot seems well exposed, bordering on the hot side. The title is good, but it brings expectations of refreshment -- or liquid. <br/> <br/>the top left area has a strange gradation of tone which is distracting, and the angle of the glass sort of leads you up into that zone.</td>', 'this shot seems well exposed, bordering on the hot side. The title is good, but it brings expectations of refreshment -- or liquid.  the top left area has a strange gradation of tone which is distracting, and the angle of the glass sort of leads you up into that zone.', '2011-05-04 20:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404480, 949469, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice smoke shape. seems weird where it''s placed, I would have expected it above one of the two glasses, not in the middle. <br/> <br/>the liquid that''s spilled looks like metal, it''s interesting, although maybe not your intentions. I think a bit more contrast would set this image apart and make it stronger.</td>', 'nice smoke shape. seems weird where it''s placed, I would have expected it above one of the two glasses, not in the middle.  the liquid that''s spilled looks like metal, it''s interesting, although maybe not your intentions. I think a bit more contrast would set this image apart and make it stronger.', '2011-05-04 20:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404481, 949574, 129267, '<td valign="top">The OCD in me wants to make the shot glasses parallel the edge of the table. On the technical side of things, I think that the lighting isn''t doing anything to enhance the look of the glasses.</td>', 'The OCD in me wants to make the shot glasses parallel the edge of the table. On the technical side of things, I think that the lighting isn''t doing anything to enhance the look of the glasses.', '2011-05-04 20:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404484, 949579, 129267, '<td valign="top">To be frank, I actually don''t think the reflections are the strong parts of this image. the reflection of the city in the glass is 10x more interesting than that. <br/> <br/>beautiful shot/exposure. sharpness feels a bit finicky, like maybe this is a crop.</td>', 'To be frank, I actually don''t think the reflections are the strong parts of this image. the reflection of the city in the glass is 10x more interesting than that.  beautiful shot/exposure. sharpness feels a bit finicky, like maybe this is a crop.', '2011-05-04 20:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404486, 949542, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting flame/glow. The fire on the right looks like a hand/wrist/fingers. <br/> <br/>I think the specular highlight on the front of the glasses is a bit of a distraction and doesn''t show the color off well. Also wish the hairlight was a bit more even between the background/foreground plane.</td>', 'interesting flame/glow. The fire on the right looks like a hand/wrist/fingers.  I think the specular highlight on the front of the glasses is a bit of a distraction and doesn''t show the color off well. Also wish the hairlight was a bit more even between the background/foreground plane.', '2011-05-04 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
