(6404616, 949580, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice lighting in this, especially around the male''s shirt. is this a two light setup? from above and from the left?<br/> <br/> I like not seeing his eyes. With such dramatic lighting though, this feels so .... clean. The model is good, full of expression, but I think this shot is too wide, and can get the same mood/effect without so much of the clutter.</td>', 'nice lighting in this, especially around the male''s shirt. is this a two light setup? from above and from the left?  I like not seeing his eyes. With such dramatic lighting though, this feels so .... clean. The model is good, full of expression, but I think this shot is too wide, and can get the same mood/effect without so much of the clutter.', '2011-05-04 23:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404621, 949729, 129267, '<td valign="top">The can looks refreshing, and all the technicals are spot on. I like the red of the glass matching with the red of the can. I wish the drink itself looked a bit more... alive. It looks almost flat, maybe just a jiggle or a stir to get some of the carbonation to kick up would have helped?</td>', 'The can looks refreshing, and all the technicals are spot on. I like the red of the glass matching with the red of the can. I wish the drink itself looked a bit more... alive. It looks almost flat, maybe just a jiggle or a stir to get some of the carbonation to kick up would have helped?', '2011-05-04 23:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404629, 949740, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what I''m looking at. I see a wine glass and a painting/colored fabric. On the technical side, the lighting feels a bit flat on the wine glass, especially around the  base. the little black things are interesting, and make a neat texture, but I don''t get what they are, and their smallish size makes the wine glass look like it''s very large.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what I''m looking at. I see a wine glass and a painting/colored fabric. On the technical side, the lighting feels a bit flat on the wine glass, especially around the  base. the little black things are interesting, and make a neat texture, but I don''t get what they are, and their smallish size makes the wine glass look like it''s very large.', '2011-05-04 23:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404630, 949717, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting subject.  I''m curious if you bought the mint like that, or molded it yourself. <br/> <br/>on the technical side, everything on black makes this look like it''s floating. I wish there was something to ground it, or help establish perspective.</td>', 'interesting subject.  I''m curious if you bought the mint like that, or molded it yourself.  on the technical side, everything on black makes this look like it''s floating. I wish there was something to ground it, or help establish perspective.', '2011-05-04 23:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404635, 949489, 129267, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a little bit more effective with a better liquor bottle. the color is nice, but the shape is reminiscent of a wine bottle, and wine &amp; shotglasses don''t really have that sort of relationship to one another. <br/> <br/>on the technical side, I like the crop &amp; exposure. everything seems sharp. The shot glas is a bit dingy looking on the right side (in the reflection area).</td>', 'I think this would have been a little bit more effective with a better liquor bottle. the color is nice, but the shape is reminiscent of a wine bottle, and wine & shotglasses don''t really have that sort of relationship to one another.  on the technical side, I like the crop & exposure. everything seems sharp. The shot glas is a bit dingy looking on the right side (in the reflection area).', '2011-05-04 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
