(6405140, 949691, 132296, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2011-05-05 16:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405141, 949542, 132296, '<td valign="top">Interesting flame pattern.</td>', 'Interesting flame pattern.', '2011-05-05 16:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405142, 948626, 86447, '<td valign="top">8 from me... love the reflection and textures... and the light.</td>', '8 from me... love the reflection and textures... and the light.', '2011-05-05 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405143, 949712, 132296, '<td valign="top">Ahahahahahah.</td>', 'Ahahahahahah.', '2011-05-05 16:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405144, 949665, 86447, '<td valign="top">an eight from me... could be brighter... but I love how clean it is, even in Basic.</td>', 'an eight from me... could be brighter... but I love how clean it is, even in Basic.', '2011-05-05 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405145, 949489, 86447, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant and attractive.  8</td>', 'Simple and elegant and attractive.  8', '2011-05-05 16:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405172, 949700, 132297, '<td valign="top">great mix of colors with the red and black</td>', 'great mix of colors with the red and black', '2011-05-05 17:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405175, 949712, 132297, '<td valign="top">i like the concept, but the hall of bullet doesn''t look that sharp way on the sun glasses in real</td>', 'i like the concept, but the hall of bullet doesn''t look that sharp way on the sun glasses in real', '2011-05-05 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405194, 949494, 129267, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot of weird materiality in this. I don''t mind the dirty/dusty/grungy look, but I do wish it was a little more consistent, for example, the material that the glasses are sitting on vs the more scratched/less reflective metallic background. I like the back-lighting, but it seems like the light source is really smally (can see hairlights on the right glass and middle glass, but not the left-most glass.</td>', 'there''s a lot of weird materiality in this. I don''t mind the dirty/dusty/grungy look, but I do wish it was a little more consistent, for example, the material that the glasses are sitting on vs the more scratched/less reflective metallic background. I like the back-lighting, but it seems like the light source is really smally (can see hairlights on the right glass and middle glass, but not the left-most glass.', '2011-05-05 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405195, 949732, 129267, '<td valign="top">the ''blood'' on those glasses looks entirely too real. I can''t say I''m a terrible fan of the pun, or the pink glasses. the ''blood'' dripping is interesting, especially at the base of the glasses, and I''m not sure the big splotchy puddle is even necessary, and feels like it takes away from the authenticity of the scene.</td>', 'the ''blood'' on those glasses looks entirely too real. I can''t say I''m a terrible fan of the pun, or the pink glasses. the ''blood'' dripping is interesting, especially at the base of the glasses, and I''m not sure the big splotchy puddle is even necessary, and feels like it takes away from the authenticity of the scene.', '2011-05-05 18:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405198, 949737, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice emphasis on shape, I appreciate that. <br/> <br/>with the perspective flattening everything out, I almost wish it was cross lit a bit to even-further get rid of the shadows. <br/> <br/>only other suggestion is that your lime looks awfully dated, either old or dry, and a bit of freshness would really make it look better.</td>', 'nice emphasis on shape, I appreciate that.  with the perspective flattening everything out, I almost wish it was cross lit a bit to even-further get rid of the shadows.  only other suggestion is that your lime looks awfully dated, either old or dry, and a bit of freshness would really make it look better.', '2011-05-05 18:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405201, 949700, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, smooth colors. the bokeh is a little uncommon for ''product'' shots. The only critique I really have is nit-picky, I don''t care much for the little white reflections on the top of the vertical shot glass.</td>', 'nice lighting, smooth colors. the bokeh is a little uncommon for ''product'' shots. The only critique I really have is nit-picky, I don''t care much for the little white reflections on the top of the vertical shot glass.', '2011-05-05 18:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405406, 949690, 129267, '<td valign="top">for a shot like this, it''d be nice if there was more in the image- that is, a story about why there''s a shotglass outside on the concrete. maybe showing more of the surroundings, or someone passed out drunk, or.... something.<br/> <br/>as it stands, it''s sorta bland, the lighting isn''t terrible, but it''s not great either. there''s a very strong/warm color cast, which would be nice -- if there was more clue to the environment.</td>', 'for a shot like this, it''d be nice if there was more in the image- that is, a story about why there''s a shotglass outside on the concrete. maybe showing more of the surroundings, or someone passed out drunk, or.... something. as it stands, it''s sorta bland, the lighting isn''t terrible, but it''s not great either. there''s a very strong/warm color cast, which would be nice -- if there was more clue to the environment.', '2011-05-06 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405407, 949651, 129267, '<td valign="top">this feels a bit flat in the contrast. the depth of field works well, and I like the way the frame is filled, but I wish there was something .. more.</td>', 'this feels a bit flat in the contrast. the depth of field works well, and I like the way the frame is filled, but I wish there was something .. more.', '2011-05-06 00:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405409, 949728, 129267, '<td valign="top">an interesting shot, I''ve been wanting to try something similar, just to say i''ve done it :D<br/> <br/>the colors are nice, and the reflections create an interesting effect, but my biggest gripe here would be that the music notes seem completely unrelated to shotglasses/drinking. could be interesting and relevant with things like cherries, lemon/lime wedges, or even colorful bottles of alcohol/mixers.</td>', 'an interesting shot, I''ve been wanting to try something similar, just to say i''ve done it :D the colors are nice, and the reflections create an interesting effect, but my biggest gripe here would be that the music notes seem completely unrelated to shotglasses/drinking. could be interesting and relevant with things like cherries, lemon/lime wedges, or even colorful bottles of alcohol/mixers.', '2011-05-06 00:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405417, 949712, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the pun. <br/> <br/>here''s what I think is working/not working. <br/> <br/>working- i noticed the hole right away, focus is sharp.<br/>not working as well- it seems a bit dark overall. the table seems a bit crooked/angled, and you can see the seam on the left side. <br/> <br/>on a different level, I think this would be stronger without the gun. or if it was pushed a bit farther back in the DOF. As it sits now, the gun is struggling to be the center of attention, I think due to the dynamic angle, and the fact that it holds more contrast than the glasses do.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the pun.  here''s what I think is working/not working.  working- i noticed the hole right away, focus is sharp.not working as well- it seems a bit dark overall. the table seems a bit crooked/angled, and you can see the seam on the left side.  on a different level, I think this would be stronger without the gun. or if it was pushed a bit farther back in the DOF. As it sits now, the gun is struggling to be the center of attention, I think due to the dynamic angle, and the fact that it holds more contrast than the glasses do.', '2011-05-06 00:37:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6405419, 949477, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like this lighting, something I''ll have to try, even if it is a bit in the center of it. I think the focal point is the edge of the horizontal buckshot, the metal end, and if so, it feels a bit soft in the post processing. i''m not a big fan of the pun, but I think this could have been pushed further, it''s almost as if you weren''t sure people were in it, so you showed a shotglass. I think with the buckshot in the frame, some broken glass would have been more appropriate.</td>', 'I like this lighting, something I''ll have to try, even if it is a bit in the center of it. I think the focal point is the edge of the horizontal buckshot, the metal end, and if so, it feels a bit soft in the post processing. i''m not a big fan of the pun, but I think this could have been pushed further, it''s almost as if you weren''t sure people were in it, so you showed a shotglass. I think with the buckshot in the frame, some broken glass would have been more appropriate.', '2011-05-06 00:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405613, 949732, 69325, '<td valign="top">heh, should have put this in the pun challenge</td>', 'heh, should have put this in the pun challenge', '2011-05-06 10:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405634, 948344, 101838, '<td valign="top">If those are the real bottles, then this should be a bear or a latte glass. I would not drink those guys in such a dose. :)</td>', 'If those are the real bottles, then this should be a bear or a latte glass. I would not drink those guys in such a dose. :)', '2011-05-06 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405665, 949684, 131226, '<td valign="top">Love the rich colors, textures and lighting.  Old time bar feel and look is a 10.</td>', 'Love the rich colors, textures and lighting.  Old time bar feel and look is a 10.', '2011-05-06 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405667, 949475, 131226, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How did you do this?  Awesome and captures the spirit of the challenge well.</td>', 'Wow!  How did you do this?  Awesome and captures the spirit of the challenge well.', '2011-05-06 12:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
