(6406711, 949475, 130760, '<td valign="top">perfect!!!!! 10!!!</td>', 'perfect!!!!! 10!!!', '2011-05-07 17:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406714, 949469, 130760, '<td valign="top">verrryyyyy cool!!! llove those glasses!!!! where in the world did u get them!!!???</td>', 'verrryyyyy cool!!! llove those glasses!!!! where in the world did u get them!!!???', '2011-05-07 17:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407274, 949676, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key look, there''s still plenty of contrast, although I do wish that the rim of the glass wasn''t as blown out. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure what the object in the shot glass is... It looks like ice, but it has a strangely unidentifiable shape to it, almost like the pipes in super mario bros. <br/> <br/>overall it''s not a bad shot, but lacks the huge visual punch/greater meaning that would take this to the next level.</td>', 'I like the high-key look, there''s still plenty of contrast, although I do wish that the rim of the glass wasn''t as blown out.  I''m not sure what the object in the shot glass is... It looks like ice, but it has a strangely unidentifiable shape to it, almost like the pipes in super mario bros.  overall it''s not a bad shot, but lacks the huge visual punch/greater meaning that would take this to the next level.', '2011-05-08 03:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407276, 949475, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice fun looking shot, expect it to do well. <br/> <br/>on the technical side of this, the cropping needs some rotation still, it''s just a smidge leaning still. I think the only other thing that I''d like to see done just a bit differently is that the shotglass seems *very* close to the edge of the table, which makes the background feel a bit overwhelming/close.</td>', 'nice fun looking shot, expect it to do well.  on the technical side of this, the cropping needs some rotation still, it''s just a smidge leaning still. I think the only other thing that I''d like to see done just a bit differently is that the shotglass seems *very* close to the edge of the table, which makes the background feel a bit overwhelming/close.', '2011-05-08 03:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407277, 949063, 129267, '<td valign="top">this feels really dark... not just in exposure. between the black background and the blue color cast, it seems a bit uninviting. <br/> <br/>I find it interesting to include both both organic and industrial textures, but I''m not sure this is pushed enough.</td>', 'this feels really dark... not just in exposure. between the black background and the blue color cast, it seems a bit uninviting.  I find it interesting to include both both organic and industrial textures, but I''m not sure this is pushed enough.', '2011-05-08 03:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407280, 949724, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, and I think the crop is working. I''m not a fan of the color casts, I think it''s the green that seems strange to me, or rather that the green feels like it''s pulling my eye away from the frontmost cup.</td>', 'I like the angle, and I think the crop is working. I''m not a fan of the color casts, I think it''s the green that seems strange to me, or rather that the green feels like it''s pulling my eye away from the frontmost cup.', '2011-05-08 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407282, 949628, 129267, '<td valign="top">that glass on the left is lovely, so creamy. The reflections in the right glass aren''t as interesting to me, the blue seems a bit out of place against the warm composition. <br/> <br/>any chance you''d be willing to share your lighting on this one?</td>', 'that glass on the left is lovely, so creamy. The reflections in the right glass aren''t as interesting to me, the blue seems a bit out of place against the warm composition.  any chance you''d be willing to share your lighting on this one?', '2011-05-08 03:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407284, 949655, 129267, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to find the shotglasses in this scene, and when I did, I felt like they were kind of arbitrarily used. <br/> <br/>the focus and lighting are both treating the two cards on the table as being the most important thing.</td>', 'It took me a while to find the shotglasses in this scene, and when I did, I felt like they were kind of arbitrarily used.  the focus and lighting are both treating the two cards on the table as being the most important thing.', '2011-05-08 03:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407285, 948550, 129267, '<td valign="top">It looks like a robots eye. I like the flatness and color, but I think the background and crop feel a bit boring/default. this might look good with a bit of a wooden texture behind it.</td>', 'It looks like a robots eye. I like the flatness and color, but I think the background and crop feel a bit boring/default. this might look good with a bit of a wooden texture behind it.', '2011-05-08 03:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407287, 949582, 129267, '<td valign="top">looks delicious, although a bit short in the technical department. <br/> <br/>I like the patterned background, red drink, and very action oriented shot. I would like to see some more lighting, especially the bottom row of glasses, and a bit more symmetrical of a crop.</td>', 'looks delicious, although a bit short in the technical department.  I like the patterned background, red drink, and very action oriented shot. I would like to see some more lighting, especially the bottom row of glasses, and a bit more symmetrical of a crop.', '2011-05-08 04:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407289, 948626, 129267, '<td valign="top">When I think whiskey, I think of color, so I find it strange to have a black and white scene.<br/> <br/>the juxtaposition of elegant glass/stonework, combined with the rough &amp; tough stereotype of whiskey drinkers, and the strange demonic little figurine is interesting, but also a bit confusing. I can see the relationsip between the alcohol and figurine, but I don''t quite buy the floor. <br/> <br/>on a formal note, lighting is beautiful.</td>', 'When I think whiskey, I think of color, so I find it strange to have a black and white scene. the juxtaposition of elegant glass/stonework, combined with the rough & tough stereotype of whiskey drinkers, and the strange demonic little figurine is interesting, but also a bit confusing. I can see the relationsip between the alcohol and figurine, but I don''t quite buy the floor.  on a formal note, lighting is beautiful.', '2011-05-08 04:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407291, 949626, 129267, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how to quite describe this. It feels so... smooth. I like that it''s not on pure white and the cool tones in this. There''s a hair, or scratch on the left side that I''m feeling a bit OCD about (and lower right corner).<br/> <br/>focus is great, as is the rim light on the vertical glass. <br/> <br/>good job.</td>', 'I don''t know how to quite describe this. It feels so... smooth. I like that it''s not on pure white and the cool tones in this. There''s a hair, or scratch on the left side that I''m feeling a bit OCD about (and lower right corner). focus is great, as is the rim light on the vertical glass.  good job.', '2011-05-08 04:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407295, 949684, 129267, '<td valign="top">one and a half shots of bourbon. <br/> <br/>the big thing about this shot that''s irking me is that the angled glasses aren''t angled enough to feel intentional. I like the wooden texture, and I don''t even mind the hard lighting.</td>', 'one and a half shots of bourbon.  the big thing about this shot that''s irking me is that the angled glasses aren''t angled enough to feel intentional. I like the wooden texture, and I don''t even mind the hard lighting.', '2011-05-08 04:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407307, 949447, 129267, '<td valign="top">for a shot like this, there''s a bit of an expectation that everything is perfect. It''s a funny idea, but there''s a few things formally that bring it down for me. The shot glasses being just a bit crooked is slightly bothersome, and I find the clothing choices (jacket with reflective zipper, metallic jewellery and a button down shirt) to take attention away from the face and quirky intentions.</td>', 'for a shot like this, there''s a bit of an expectation that everything is perfect. It''s a funny idea, but there''s a few things formally that bring it down for me. The shot glasses being just a bit crooked is slightly bothersome, and I find the clothing choices (jacket with reflective zipper, metallic jewellery and a button down shirt) to take attention away from the face and quirky intentions.', '2011-05-08 04:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407309, 949709, 129267, '<td valign="top">this seems nicely lit, but compositionally feels a bit flat. everything seems to be on the same visual plane, and treated as being equally important. The tilted bottle is a nice touch to try and make it more dynamic, but it''s pushed so far forward in the visual plane that it makes me unsure of what the true focal point is supposed to be.</td>', 'this seems nicely lit, but compositionally feels a bit flat. everything seems to be on the same visual plane, and treated as being equally important. The tilted bottle is a nice touch to try and make it more dynamic, but it''s pushed so far forward in the visual plane that it makes me unsure of what the true focal point is supposed to be.', '2011-05-08 04:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407311, 949691, 129267, '<td valign="top">with this same title, it could have been interesting if the blue and yellow liquid were pouring and being combined to make a new green liquid. <br/> <br/>as it sits now, i find the back light to be really distracting. it looks like a huge alien head staring at me as I vote.</td>', 'with this same title, it could have been interesting if the blue and yellow liquid were pouring and being combined to make a new green liquid.  as it sits now, i find the back light to be really distracting. it looks like a huge alien head staring at me as I vote.', '2011-05-08 04:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407514, 949574, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting is really hurting this image. Also, do pull of such a tough composition the image needs to be sharp as a tack. Your focus is a little soft. 4</td>', 'Very harsh lighting is really hurting this image. Also, do pull of such a tough composition the image needs to be sharp as a tack. Your focus is a little soft. 4', '2011-05-08 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407518, 949491, 102315, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, cool shot glasses, and good setup. Just not interesting enough.</td>', 'Good lighting, cool shot glasses, and good setup. Just not interesting enough.', '2011-05-08 12:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407520, 949420, 102315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Like the idea and the execution. The blue coloring is nice. Only critique would be that the lemon seems to be a tad bright.</td>', 'Beautiful. Like the idea and the execution. The blue coloring is nice. Only critique would be that the lemon seems to be a tad bright.', '2011-05-08 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407522, 949690, 102315, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the grain or the composition of this one. Looks like a snapshot of a shot glass.</td>', 'Don''t like the grain or the composition of this one. Looks like a snapshot of a shot glass.', '2011-05-08 12:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6407523, 949731, 102315, '<td valign="top">Ozzy reference? If so I like the dark feel of the image. Just think it is too dark with not enough contrast.</td>', 'Ozzy reference? If so I like the dark feel of the image. Just think it is too dark with not enough contrast.', '2011-05-08 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
