(6410327, 949420, 93421, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Yum!  And how did that drop get so high up!!?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The high drop is actually coming from above Johanna i.e. it hasn''t hit the tequila yet (",</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Yum!  And how did that drop get so high up!!??   The high drop is actually coming from above Johanna i.e. it hasn''t hit the tequila yet (",', '2011-05-11 05:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
