(6410567, 949674, 43774, '<td valign="top">You asked for feedback.<br/> <br/>I gave it a 6. I liked the colour and the abstractness of it. I would have scored it higher if the rim was perfect without dust or scratches.<br/> <br/>Another idea why it did not score higher, maybe some people didn''t think this was a shot glass.</td>', 'You asked for feedback. I gave it a 6. I liked the colour and the abstractness of it. I would have scored it higher if the rim was perfect without dust or scratches. Another idea why it did not score higher, maybe some people didn''t think this was a shot glass.', '2011-05-11 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
