(6423712, 949674, 132996, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''m ok with the glass not being perfectly clean. It would be almost impossible to have a perfectly clean glass with macro anyway. We don''t always need perfection. :) Dust adds character.</td>', 'Personally, I''m ok with the glass not being perfectly clean. It would be almost impossible to have a perfectly clean glass with macro anyway. We don''t always need perfection. :) Dust adds character.', '2011-05-24 22:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
